{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4e778c23c5210df1b766ca25d0389b95f9a439e385a68fa3abe8130b5bbf60b7", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影が終わった。\n次はインタビューだな。美希のところに行ってみよう）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄结束了。\n接下来是采访吧。去美希那边看看）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "d509027f8a6e289de3ef79749d657a8786b3a6468358d1cc308a4e118090ddb5", "ja": "{$P$}。ミキのカワイくて\nセクシーなとこ、ちゃんと見ててくれた？", "zh": "{$P$}。美希可爱又性感的一面，你都有好好看到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0b8941086131b3dc6cae1afc2c33f6b9ba2ae9c8a83a84feb49d55aed12b0ce5", "ja": "ああ！　いい表情が撮れたって、スタッフさんも\n褒めてたよ。この調子でインタビューも頑張ろうな。", "zh": "啊！工作人员也夸你了，说拍到了很棒的表情。照这个状态，采访也要加油啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "8ef8961cf8a77e9f6ab23f7454f7393af3403326e16196c96b6d6b8f95c4abc3", "ja": "はいなのー！　……ねえ、{$P$}？\nインタビューって、何のお話するんだっけ？", "zh": "好哒——！……那个，{$P$}？\n采访要聊些什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0a92dcd68111640cefcbe064c97229301b25fe043c714e7a8cfbfcc298ad2d92", "ja": "この前、質問状渡したんだけどな……。読者から、\n美容の秘訣が知りたいって、意見が多かったそうだ。", "zh": "前阵子我不是把问题单交给你了吗……听说读者们纷纷表示，想知道美容秘诀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "4d6299e2b2ad8eb7ccfa74c70a9b1d668ea8ab62c5cdcffdbc0d3347cc38cf2f", "ja": "そうなんだ。みんなミキのこと、知りたいんだね。\nでも……ミキ、なんにもしてないよ？", "zh": "原来是这样。大家都想了解美希呢。\n不过……美希什么都没做呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "d3320614c228d4486326e1b1dfc9a00c8b54cecbf7924595164324d412786850", "ja": "お家にいる時は、のんびりお昼寝してるし……\n事務所でもお昼寝して、劇場でもお昼寝してるの！", "zh": "在家里的时候，我会悠闲地睡午觉……\n在事务所也睡午觉，在剧场也睡午觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1007_p", "source_sha256": "dfea48d9f102a372212d4bc8c9a2194e8c41e76699f4bdf01e6c77094eda56e5", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nお昼寝以外のことはしてたりしないのか？", "zh": "这、这样啊……  \n除了午睡以外，你就没做点别的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "35c298008532cae85b3d456369f555a124fb81c0fa6e2558d2d81b9af654de90", "ja": "あとはおにぎり食べたり、イチゴババロア食べてるよ！\nでも聞きたいのって、そういうことじゃないよね？", "zh": "剩下的就是吃吃饭团、吃吃草莓芭芭露亚哦！\n不过你想问的，应该不是这些吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "1105b7bb0633e4052cc2f663409d593f74e0e4de3a5024212e2924c3400aec7b", "ja": "うーん……寝る前にのびーってしたりするかも？\nあっ、しない時もあるかも。あはっ☆", "zh": "嗯……睡觉前可能会伸个懒腰吧？\n啊，也可能有时候不会。啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4ce7ea800f38ceb625a4205390297107aa6977d76cf5c5468e365022cef9c608", "ja": "なるほど……。寝て、食べて、動いて……\n自由に過ごすのが、美容の秘訣かもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此……睡觉、吃饭、活动……\n自由自在地生活，或许就是保持美丽的秘诀吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "b8b92bbd6e2415a6d71ab823222582e18e1d83196375d6f150a52e9d415571a8", "ja": "そうなの？　よくわかんないけど……\nミキが好きなことしてるのが、すごいってこと？", "zh": "是这样吗？虽然不是很明白……\n也就是说，美希做自己喜欢的事，很厉害？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1012_p", "source_sha256": "36cbc70d5c2a49988abb066e2d3163927283e7b43b2951051bfa876270887460", "ja": "ああ。美希が美希のままでいられる生活なんて、\n他の誰にもマネできないからな。", "zh": "是啊。能让美希保持自我地生活，其他任何人都无法模仿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "fc81aa22b442db71c4973eefb38dfce8a05437199b8f8a582b28c1bfb3567560", "ja": "{$P$}にホメられたの！　えへへ♪\n……あ、ヒケツ思い出したの。それはね……。", "zh": "被{$P$}夸奖了呢！嘿嘿♪\n……啊，美希想起来秘诀了。那就是呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "0a80c5c104b714761d2dee6471271c82adb163f4a4e04a66f3c54a5e67332fe4", "ja": "好きな人がいること！　{$P$}には\nいつもカワイイミキを見てもらいたいって思うな。", "zh": "那就是有了喜欢的人！美希总是\n想要让{$P$}看到可爱的自己呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "4cc1e643e0adf41788f640c9a03690bae894fc5a9dc6151ad814bc8b70e1e779", "ja": "うん、これでインタビューの答えはバッチリなの！\nそれじゃ、行ってくるね♪", "zh": "嗯，这样采访的回答就完美啦！  \n那我先走啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0263_1016_p", "source_sha256": "59ad6972b3ec096c0b575ab68e6f00d7bd120f34ec214c1fb2ba3bf4faa10d6e", "ja": "み、美希！？　それはちょっと……。\nもう少し考え直そう！　おーい、美希ー！", "zh": "美、美希！？　那样有点……\n再稍微重新考虑一下吧！喂——美希——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
